  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Canada Student Grant for Students with Disabilities ($2,800 per program year); Canada Student Grant for Services and Equipment (up to $20,000 per program year); Disability Assessment Reimbursement (up to $3,500 per year); Canada Repayment Assistance Program for Students with Disabilities; Canada Severe Permanent Disability Benefit; BC Supplemental Bursary for Students with Disabilities ($800 and $400 per program year); B.C. Access Grant for Students with Disabilities (up to $1,560 per program year); Assistance Program for Students with Disabilities (up to $12,000 per program year); B.C. Access Grant for Deaf Students (up to $30,000 per program year); Learning Disability Assessment Bursary (up to $3,500 per year); Provision for Students with Severe Disabilities; Accessible Communication Equity; Public Post-Secondary Loan Program."
  } ],
