  "https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression" : [ {
    "@value" : "Students applying for ASF programs must submit an Appendix 8 - Disability Programs Application. In addition to the Appendix 8 form, students may also be required to provide documentation from a qualified medical assessor. The documentation must be signed and dated within the last three years (unless it is a psycho-educational assessment which must be dated within the last five years) or conducted after the age of 18."
  } ]
