  "https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression" : [ {
    "@value" : "A letter from a responsible third party testifying as to the truthfulness of the student’s explanation and providing an independent assessment of the situation. The ‘third party’ could be any of the following: counselor, psychologist, religious advisor, doctor, teacher, and/or mature relative outside the immediate family or family friend (the status of the third party and their relationship to the student must be identified in the letter)."
  } ]
