  "https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasActionExpression" : [ {
    "@value" : "Parental expected contribution from assets is calculated as one percent of the total net value of all eligible assets (excluding RRSPs, motor vehicles, principal residence and business/farm), in excess of a standard exemption of $150,000. Divide this by the number of the parents’ dependants who are attending post-secondary studies."
