    "@value" : "If planned off-the-job training is unable to take place as scheduled in any calendar month, a retrospective break in learning is not required as long as there is OTJT active learning in the following calendar month. Where there is no OTJT active learning for 2 consecutive calendar months, a retrospective break in learning must be used."
