    "@value" : "Parents' Contribution Calculation Rule"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Structural calculation rule defining how the parents' contribution is computed, including the 12% conversion rate, the addition of available income, and the application of Table A5 rates (22% to 47%), with a condition that negative asset contributions are set to zero."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom" : [ {
