  "https://www.w3id.org/cco/cco#hasConditionExpression" : [ {
    "@value" : "The student's parents refuse to complete the FAFSA; or The student's parents do not and will not provide any financial support to the student (include the date support ended). If the parents refuse to sign and date a statement to this effect, you must get documentation from a third party (the student is not sufficient), such as a teacher, counselor, cleric, or court."
