  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Apprenticeship levy is a levy on UK employers to raise funds to pay for apprenticeship training and assessment, charged at 0.5% of an employer’s pay bill, with each employer receiving an allowance of £15,000 to offset against their levy payment."
