  }, {
    "@value" : "A bursary provided to care leavers to support their apprenticeship."
  }, {
    "@value" : "A bursary provided to eligible apprentices who are care leavers, as defined in paragraphs 108 and 110 of the relevant regulation."
  }, {
    "@value" : "A bursary specifically for care leavers participating in apprenticeships."
  }, {
    "@value" : "A one-off financial bursary provided to eligible care leaver apprentices."
  }, {
    "@value" : "A tax-free payment to acknowledge the additional financial burden that care leavers encounter when living in, or leaving, care, and not treated as income in Universal Credit calculations."
  }, {
    "@value" : "Care leavers’ bursary is an additional £3,000 payment (paid in 3 instalments) that we pay to apprentices who are in care or are care leavers, and who started their apprenticeship training on or after 1"
