    "@value" : "Verification of the student's eligibility for an education and training voucher under the John H. Chafee Foster Care Program under section 477 of the Social Security Act (42 U.S.C. 677) is a documented phone call or written statement from a financial aid administrator who documented the student's circumstance in the same or a prior award year."
